@mruberry @ngimel and I suspect leaf streams aren't properly stashed for gradients created out of place by torch.autograd.grad, so ops following backward() call might not properly be synced with backward ops that created those gradients (in other words, ops following backward can't use those gradients safely).
I'll investigate and PR a fix if needed, filing so I don't forget.
cc @ezyang @albanD @zou3519 @gqchen @pearu @nikitaved @soulitzer @lezcano @ngimel
